{"n":24,"title":"Tu forms, to live, but","summary":"The tu form of -er verbs also sounds like the verb without -er, but it's written with -es: tu manges, tu fermes. habiter = to live (somewhere): Tu habites où ? Il n'habite pas ici. mais = but: Je ne suis pas d'ici, mais j'habite ici.","points":["je mange, tu manges, il/elle mange all sound the same. Only the spelling differs (-e, -es, -e).","Questions: Manges-tu ? or just Tu manges ?","habiter = to live somewhere (like 'habitat'). The h is silent, so: j'habite, n'habite.","Où habites-tu ? / Tu habites où ? = Where do you live?","Some liaisons are optional: pas ici.","mais = but (ai sounds like è)."],"vocab":[{"fr":"tu manges","en":"you eat"},{"fr":"je ferme / tu fermes","en":"I close / you close"},{"fr":"habiter","en":"to live (somewhere)"},{"fr":"ici","en":"here"},{"fr":"mais","en":"but"}],"drills":[{"en":"You eat.","fr":"Tu manges.","t":29},{"en":"Are you eating?","fr":"Manges-tu ?","t":41},{"en":"I'm closing it. (le)","fr":"Je le ferme.","t":102},{"en":"I'm closing it. (la porte)","fr":"Je la ferme.","t":112},{"en":"He closes.","fr":"Il ferme.","t":125},{"en":"You close.","fr":"Tu fermes.","t":137},{"en":"Are you locking it? (la porte)","fr":"Tu la fermes à clé ?","t":163},{"en":"to live (somewhere)","fr":"habiter","t":178},{"en":"You live.","fr":"Tu habites.","t":195},{"en":"Where do you live?","fr":"Où habites-tu ?","t":206},{"en":"Where do you live? (casual)","fr":"Tu habites où ?","t":219},{"en":"He lives here.","fr":"Il habite ici.","t":238},{"en":"He doesn't live here.","fr":"Il n'habite pas ici.","t":246},{"en":"I'm from here.","fr":"Je suis d'ici.","t":317},{"en":"I'm not from here.","fr":"Je ne suis pas d'ici.","t":325},{"en":"I'm not from here, but I live here.","fr":"Je ne suis pas d'ici, mais j'habite ici.","t":361}],"transcript":[{"t":0.46,"x":"What was to eat again?"},{"t":3.46,"x":"Mange."},{"t":4.46,"x":"Very good. M-a-n-g-e-r, mange."},{"t":7.46,"x":"And I eat, I'm eating."},{"t":11.46,"x":"Je mange."},{"t":13.46,"x":"Je mange. He eats, he's eating."},{"t":17.9,"x":"Il mange."},{"t":18.9,"x":"Il mange. She eats, she's eating."},{"t":23.9,"x":"Elle mange."},{"t":24.9,"x":"Elle mange. Good."},{"t":26.9,"x":"And all of these words, m-a-n-g-e."},{"t":28.9,"x":"For you, for you,"},{"t":30.9,"x":"we also just pronounce the e-r verb without its ending."},{"t":34.9,"x":"So you eat would be?"},{"t":37.9,"x":"Tu mange."},{"t":40.57,"x":"Tu mange. Are you eating?"},{"t":44.57,"x":"Mange, tu."},{"t":46.57,"x":"Mange, tu. So the form we have for you,"},{"t":49.57,"x":"it sounds like m-a-n-g-e without the e-r."},{"t":52.57,"x":"But for you, we add e-s when we remove our e-r."},{"t":57.57,"x":"So rather than just an e to make sure we pronounce the last consonant,"},{"t":61.57,"x":"we also have an s here. We add e-s."},{"t":64.57,"x":"But it sounds exactly the same as the other forms,"},{"t":67.57,"x":"just like the two verb without its two ending."},{"t":71.57,"x":"Mange, mange."},{"t":72.57,"x":"That last e-s isn't pronounced at all."},{"t":76.57,"x":"What was to confirm?"},{"t":79.57,"x":"Confirmé."},{"t":81.57,"x":"Confirmé."},{"t":82.57,"x":"And to close was very similar."},{"t":84.57,"x":"We got rid of this con,"},{"t":86.57,"x":"and we had a very small change to get to close."},{"t":89.57,"x":"Fermé."},{"t":92.01,"x":"Fermé, very good. F-i-a-m-i-a, fermé."},{"t":97.01,"x":"I close, I'm closing."},{"t":100.01,"x":"Je ferme."},{"t":102.01,"x":"Je ferme, good. I'm closing it."},{"t":107.01,"x":"Dieu le ferme."},{"t":110.01,"x":"Je le ferme."},{"t":112.01,"x":"And what if you meant the door?"},{"t":114.01,"x":"When you said I'm closing it,"},{"t":116.01,"x":"what if you meant la porte?"},{"t":119.01,"x":"Dieu la ferme."},{"t":125.01,"x":"He closes."},{"t":127.01,"x":"Il ferme."},{"t":131.01,"x":"And she closes."},{"t":134.01,"x":"Elle ferme."},{"t":137.01,"x":"You close."},{"t":139.01,"x":"Tu ferme."},{"t":143.38,"x":"Good. So here we have e-s, no f-e-r-m-e-s,"},{"t":146.38,"x":"but it sounds the same as je ferme."},{"t":149.38,"x":"Il ferme."},{"t":150.38,"x":"Tu ferme."},{"t":152.38,"x":"What was to lock?"},{"t":154.38,"x":"To close."},{"t":155.38,"x":"To key by key."},{"t":157.38,"x":"Fermé, à-c-lé."},{"t":160.76,"x":"Very good, fermé, à-c-lé."},{"t":162.76,"x":"Are you locking it?"},{"t":164.76,"x":"And we mean the door again."},{"t":166.76,"x":"Are you locking it?"},{"t":167.76,"x":"Dieu la, Dieu la ferme, à-c-lé."},{"t":175.17,"x":"Dieu la ferme, à-c-lé."},{"t":178.17,"x":"To live, to live somewhere,"},{"t":180.17,"x":"to live somewhere is à-b-té, à-b-té."},{"t":184.17,"x":"And this is h-a-b-i-t-e-r."},{"t":187.17,"x":"So we have a silent h."},{"t":189.17,"x":"À-b-té, like the English word habitat."},{"t":192.17,"x":"À-b-té, to live somewhere."},{"t":194.17,"x":"À-b-té."},{"t":195.17,"x":"You live?"},{"t":197.17,"x":"Dieu à-b-té."},{"t":199.17,"x":"Dieu à-b-té."},{"t":201.17,"x":"The word for where was o-o-u,"},{"t":204.17,"x":"o-o-o."},{"t":206.17,"x":"Where do you live?"},{"t":209.48,"x":"O-o-u, à-b-té, tu."},{"t":212.48,"x":"O-o-o, à-b-té, tu."},{"t":214.48,"x":"Or we could avoid making the inversion there,"},{"t":217.48,"x":"putting the question word on the end."},{"t":219.48,"x":"You live where?"},{"t":220.48,"x":"How would that be?"},{"t":221.48,"x":"You live where?"},{"t":223.48,"x":"Dieu à-b-té, o-o."},{"t":225.48,"x":"Good."},{"t":226.48,"x":"Dieu à-b-té, o-o."},{"t":227.48,"x":"And this would be more informal or familiar now."},{"t":230.48,"x":"Dieu à-b-té, o-o."},{"t":232.48,"x":"The word for here is ici, ici."},{"t":234.48,"x":"ici."},{"t":235.48,"x":"This is i-ci, i-ici."},{"t":237.48,"x":"ici."},{"t":238.48,"x":"He lives here."},{"t":240.48,"x":"Il à-b-té ici."},{"t":244.48,"x":"Very good."},{"t":245.48,"x":"Il à-b-té ici."},{"t":246.48,"x":"He doesn't live here."},{"t":248.48,"x":"He doesn't live here."},{"t":250.48,"x":"Il à-b-té ici."},{"t":254.48,"x":"Very good."},{"t":255.48,"x":"Il à-b-té."},{"t":256.48,"x":"You contracted n' and à-b-té."},{"t":259.48,"x":"Very good."},{"t":260.48,"x":"Il à-b-té ici."},{"t":263.48,"x":"So we have n' apostrophe h-a-b-i-t-e"},{"t":267.48,"x":"and we can do that because the h is silent."},{"t":270.48,"x":"Even though we have a consonant there,"},{"t":272.48,"x":"we still even write this contraction."},{"t":274.48,"x":"Il à-b-té ici."},{"t":277.48,"x":"And we could also have a liaison here"},{"t":279.48,"x":"with an optional one."},{"t":280.48,"x":"Not an obligatory one."},{"t":282.48,"x":"Pas ici, we could say."},{"t":284.48,"x":"Il à-b-té ici."},{"t":287.48,"x":"So some liaisons are optional in French."},{"t":290.48,"x":"What was of or from?"},{"t":293.48,"x":"De."},{"t":294.48,"x":"De."},{"t":296.48,"x":"And I can demande to demand or to ask."},{"t":300.48,"x":"From here, how would you say from here?"},{"t":304.48,"x":"De ici."},{"t":305.48,"x":"Again?"},{"t":306.48,"x":"De ici."},{"t":307.48,"x":"Very good."},{"t":308.48,"x":"De ici."},{"t":309.48,"x":"They contract the apostrophe ici."},{"t":311.48,"x":"De ici."},{"t":312.48,"x":"I am, I am was je suis."},{"t":315.48,"x":"Je suis."},{"t":316.48,"x":"Je suis."},{"t":317.48,"x":"How would you say I am from here?"},{"t":321.48,"x":"Je suis."},{"t":322.48,"x":"De ici."},{"t":323.48,"x":"Je suis."},{"t":324.48,"x":"De ici."},{"t":325.48,"x":"I am not from here."},{"t":328.82,"x":"Je ne suis pas d'ici."},{"t":331.82,"x":"Je ne suis pas d'ici."},{"t":335.82,"x":"But."},{"t":336.82,"x":"But in French."},{"t":338.82,"x":"It's spelled M-A-I-S."},{"t":341.82,"x":"How might that sound?"},{"t":343.82,"x":"M-A-I-S."},{"t":346.82,"x":"Mais."},{"t":347.82,"x":"Very good."},{"t":348.82,"x":"Mais."},{"t":349.82,"x":"A-I gives us an e sound"},{"t":351.82,"x":"like in maison, house,"},{"t":354.82,"x":"like in nécessaire,"},{"t":356.82,"x":"which has the A-I-R-E ending."},{"t":359.82,"x":"Mais."},{"t":360.82,"x":"I'm not from here,"},{"t":361.82,"x":"but I live here."},{"t":362.82,"x":"I'm not from here,"},{"t":364.82,"x":"but I live here."},{"t":366.82,"x":"Je ne suis pas d'ici."},{"t":371.82,"x":"Mais."},{"t":372.82,"x":"Je d'habite ici."},{"t":374.82,"x":"Good."},{"t":375.82,"x":"But let's go back to but."},{"t":377.82,"x":"How does that sound?"},{"t":379.82,"x":"Mais."},{"t":380.82,"x":"Mais."},{"t":382.82,"x":"That would be M-E."},{"t":384.82,"x":"M-A-I-S gives us a different sound."},{"t":388.82,"x":"Mais."},{"t":389.82,"x":"Je ne suis pas d'ici."},{"t":391.82,"x":"I'm not from here."},{"t":392.82,"x":"Je ne suis pas d'ici."},{"t":393.82,"x":"Mais."},{"t":394.82,"x":"J'habite ici."},{"t":395.82,"x":"Mais j'habite ici."},{"t":397.82,"x":"But I live here."},{"t":398.82,"x":"Very good."}]}